  "sources": [
    "Microsoft Learn: ErrorReporting Policy CSP, DisableWindowsErrorReporting: registry value Disabled under SOFTWARE\\Policies\\Microsoft\\Windows\\Windows Error Reporting (ADMX ErrorReporting.admx, enabled = 1). Windows then sends no problem reports to Microsoft.",
    "The policy is described in the Policy CSP for Pro, Enterprise and Education; Windows Home reads the same registry value, but Microsoft makes no promise for Home."
